B.eEL=new A.dv("q1",B.cr,"","Love is not love\nWhich alters when it alteration finds.","William Shakespeare, Sonnet 116 (1609)",B.zH)
B.eEl=new A.dv("q2",B.cr,"","Love alters not with his brief hours and weeks,\nBut bears it out even to the edge of doom.","William Shakespeare, Sonnet 116 (1609)",B.zH)
