B.eEh=new A.dv("q4",B.cr,"","My bounty is as boundless as the sea,\nMy love as deep; the more I give to thee,\nThe more I have, for both are infinite.","William Shakespeare, Romeo and Juliet (1597)",B.DW)
B.ns=s(["repair"],t.s)
B.eEM=new A.dv("q5",B.cr,"","The course of true love never did run smooth.","William Shakespeare, A Midsummer Night\u2019s Dream (1600)",B.ns)
B.eEf=new A.dv("q6",B.cr,"","How do I love thee? Let me count the ways.\nI love thee to the depth and breadth and height\nMy soul can reach.","Elizabeth Barrett Browning, Sonnets from the Portuguese (1850)",B.DM)
B.a0Q=s(["missing"],t.s)
B.eEr=new A.dv("q7",B.cr,"","You pierce my soul. I am half agony, half hope.","Jane Austen, Persuasion (1817)",B.a0Q)
B.a0J=s(["kind"],t.s)
B.eDR=new A.dv("q8",B.cr,"","There is no charm equal to tenderness of heart.","Jane Austen, Emma (1815)",B.a0J)
B.t4=s(["close"],t.s)
B.eEG=new A.dv("q9",B.cr,"","Whatever our souls are made of, his and mine are the same.","Emily Bront\xeb, Wuthering Heights (1847)",B.t4)
B.eDZ=new A.dv("q10",B.cr,"","You are part of my existence, part of myself.","Charles Dickens, Great Expectations (1861)",B.t4)
B.eDU=new A.dv("q11",B.cr,"","What greater thing is there for two human souls, than to feel that they are joined for life\u2014to strengthen each other in all labour, to rest on each other in all sorrow, to minister to each other in all pain\u2026","George Eliot, Adam Bede (1859)",B.zH)
B.zG=s(["space"],t.s)
B.eEw=new A.dv("q12",B.cr,"","Love one another, but make not a bond of love:\nLet it rather be a moving sea between the shores of your souls.","Kahlil Gibran, The Prophet (1923)",B.zG)
B.eEk=new A.dv("q13",B.cr,"","And stand together yet not too near together:\nFor the pillars of the temple stand apart,\nAnd the oak tree and the cypress grow not in each other\u2019s shadow.","Kahlil Gibran, The Prophet (1923)",B.zG)
B.eDO=new A.dv("q14",B.cr,"","Love gives naught but itself and takes naught but from itself.\nLove possesses not nor would it be possessed;\nFor love is sufficient unto love.","Kahlil Gibran, The Prophet (1923)",B.DW)
B.eE9=new A.dv("q15",B.cr,"","Many waters cannot quench love, neither can the floods drown it.","Song of Solomon 8:7, King James Bible (1611)",B.zH)
B.eDS=new A.dv("q16",B.cr,"","Set me as a seal upon thine heart.","Song of Solomon 8:6, King James Bible (1611)",B.t4)
B.eE6=new A.dv("q17",B.cr,"","O my Luve is like a red, red rose\nThat\u2019s newly sprung in June.","Robert Burns, A Red, Red Rose (1794)",B.DM)
B.f02=s(["admire","calm"],t.s)
B.eED=new A.dv("q18",B.cr,"","She walks in beauty, like the night\nOf cloudless climes and starry skies.","Lord Byron, She Walks in Beauty (1815)",B.f02)
B.eEp=new A.dv("q19",B.cr,"","The only way to have a friend is to be one.","Ralph Waldo Emerson, Friendship (1841)",B.a0J)
B.eEC=new A.dv("q20",B.cr,"","Happy families are all alike; every unhappy family is unhappy in its own way.","Leo Tolstoy, Anna Karenina (1878; tr. Constance Garnett, 1901)",B.ns)
B.eDN=new A.dv("q21",B.cr,"","Love is like a cough \u2014 it cannot be hidden.\n(Mapenzi ni kikohozi, hayafichiki.)","Swahili proverb",B.DM)
B.eEo=new A.dv("q22",B.cr,"","Little by little fills the measure.\n(Haba na haba hujaza kibaba.)","Swahili proverb \u2014 small daily kindness builds a love",B.zH)
B.eEJ=new A.dv("q23",B.cr,"","Where there is a will, there is a way.\n(Penye nia pana njia.)","Swahili proverb",B.ns)
B.Li=s(["team"],t.s)
B.eDY=new A.dv("q24",B.cr,"","One finger cannot crush a louse.\n(Kidole kimoja hakivunji chawa.)","Swahili proverb \u2014 you are stronger as two",B.Li)
B.eEx=new A.dv("i1",B.cW,"Turn toward the small bids",'Most love is built in tiny moments: "look at this", a sigh, a shared joke. Each one is a small bid for connection. Turning toward it \u2014 a smile, a reply, a "tell me more" \u2014 is how trust quietly grows.',u.V,B.t4)
B.f4I=s(["repair","gratitude"],t.s)
B.eEj=new A.dv("i2",B.cW,"Five warm moments for every hard one","Happy couples still argue. What helps is that the warm moments far outnumber the hard ones \u2014 roughly five good moments for every difficult one. A thank-you, a laugh, a touch all count.",u.V,B.f4I)
B.eEm=new A.dv("i3",B.cW,"Start soft",'How a hard talk starts often decides how it ends. Begin gently, with "I feel\u2026 about\u2026 and I need\u2026" instead of "You always\u2026". It invites them in instead of putting them on guard.',u.V,B.ns)
B.eE2=new A.dv("i4",B.cW,"Repair is a love skill",'A repair is anything that stops a fight from spiralling: a joke, "can we start again?", "I see your point". Making repairs \u2014 and accepting theirs \u2014 matters more than never fighting.',u.V,B.ns)
B.eEH=new A.dv("i5",B.cW,"The four habits to watch","Four habits quietly hurt couples: criticism, contempt, defensiveness and shutting down. Their antidotes are simple to say and worth practising: a gentle start, appreciation, taking responsibility, and a calming break.",u.V,B.ns)
B.a1_=s(["repair","calm"],t.s)
B.eEN=new A.dv("i6",B.cW,"Pause, then come back","When your heart races in an argument, nobody listens well. Agree on a pause \u2014 about 20 minutes, doing something calming \u2014 and a promise to come back. Taking a break is not walking away.",u.V,B.a1_)
B.f0H=s(["close","new"],t.s)
B.eE_=new A.dv("i7",B.cW,"Keep a map of their world","Keep learning your partner: their current worries, hopes, favourite people, what a bad day looks like for them. People change; staying curious keeps you close.",u.V,B.f0H)
B.eE8=new A.dv("i8",B.cW,"Learn their love language","People feel loved in different ways \u2014 words, time, help, gifts, touch. Notice how your partner shows love; it often hints at how they most want to receive it.","Inspired by the work of Dr. Gary Chapman",B.DW)
B.Lb=s(["gratitude"],t.s)
B.eEs=new A.dv("i9",B.cW,"Celebrate their good news",'When your partner shares good news, how you respond matters as much as support in hard times. Get curious and celebrate with them: "That\u2019s amazing \u2014 how did it feel?"','Inspired by research on "active-constructive responding" (Dr. Shelly Gable)',B.Lb)
B.eE4=new A.dv("i10",B.cW,"Gratitude grows love","Saying thank you for small things isn\u2019t just polite. Feeling noticed and appreciated makes both of you more generous with each other.","Inspired by research on gratitude in relationships",B.Lb)
B.DZ=s(["new"],t.s)
B.eDW=new A.dv("i11",B.cW,"Do something new together","Doing new things together \u2014 a new place, a new song, a new recipe \u2014 brings back some of the spark of early love. Novelty is a gift you can give each other.","Inspired by research by Dr. Arthur Aron",B.DZ)
B.f4V=s(["steady","missing"],t.s)
B.eEv=new A.dv("i12",B.cW,"Be each other\u2019s safe place",'Feeling safe with someone means knowing they\u2019ll be there. Small reassurances \u2014 "I\u2019m here", replying when you said you would \u2014 build a safe base you can both rest on.',"Inspired by attachment research (John Bowlby and others)",B.f4V)
B.eEt=new A.dv("i13",B.cW,'Apologise without a "but"','A real apology has three parts: name what you did, show you understand how it felt, and say what you\u2019ll do differently. Skip the "but".',"",B.ns)
B.eDT=new A.dv("i14",B.cW,"Rituals across the distance",'Distance makes small rituals precious: a good-morning message, a song shared at night, a call at the same time. Rituals say "you\u2019re still my person".',"",B.a0Q)
B.f0z=s(["calm","space"],t.s)
B.eEE=new A.dv("i15",B.cW,"Love yourself too","You can\u2019t pour from an empty cup. Rest, friends, your own goals \u2014 caring for yourself is part of caring for your relationship.","",B.f0z)
B.f0I=s(["close","repair"],t.s)
B.eEu=new A.dv("i16",B.cW,"Listen to understand",'Listening to understand sounds like: "So you felt\u2026 because\u2026?" Before solving anything, let them feel heard. Often that is the solution.',"",B.f0I)
B.eEB=new A.dv("i17",B.cW,"Talk about the everyday things","Money, chores and time are among the most common sources of conflict. Talk about them early and calmly, as a team planning together \u2014 not as opponents.","",B.Li)
B.eEn=new A.dv("i18",B.cW,"Forgiveness, gently","Forgiveness isn\u2019t pretending it didn\u2019t hurt. It\u2019s choosing not to carry it as a weapon \u2014 often after the hurt has been heard and repaired.","",B.ns)
B.f03=s(["admire","gratitude"],t.s)
B.eEq=new A.dv("i19",B.cW,"Say what you admire","Admire out loud. Telling your partner what you respect about them \u2014 their patience, their humour, how they treat people \u2014 keeps fondness alive.",u.V,B.f03)
B.eEi=new A.dv("i20",B.cW,"Let them influence you",'Being open to your partner\u2019s influence \u2014 "you have a point, let\u2019s do it your way this time" \u2014 is a quiet sign of respect that strengthens love.',u.V,B.Li)
B.eEg=new A.dv("t1",B.dk,"Tonight\u2019s question",'Ask each other: "What made you feel loved this week?"',"",B.t4)
B.eEF=new A.dv("t2",B.dk,"Gratitude swap","Share one thing you\u2019re grateful for about each other today. Be specific.","",B.Lb)
B.f3J=s(["new","close"],t.s)
B.eE3=new A.dv("t3",B.dk,"One song, together","Pick a song that reminds you of each other and listen together \u2014 no phones, just the song.","",B.f3J)
B.eEA=new A.dv("t4",B.dk,"Ask what matters",'Ask: "What\u2019s one small thing I could do this week that would mean a lot to you?"',"",B.DW)
B.f0G=s(["close","missing"],t.s)
B.eEy=new A.dv("t5",B.dk,"Your beginning","Tell each other about the moment you first knew you liked each other.","",B.f0G)
B.eE5=new A.dv("t6",B.dk,"Something new","Plan one new thing to try together this month \u2014 a place, a dish, a walk you\u2019ve never taken.","",B.DZ)
B.f0F=s(["close","calm"],t.s)
B.eEe=new A.dv("t7",B.dk,"The ten-minute check-in","Spend ten minutes talking about your days \u2014 just listening and taking each other\u2019s side, no fixing.","",B.f0F)
B.eEb=new A.dv("t8",B.dk,"Something ahead",'Ask: "What\u2019s something you\u2019re looking forward to?" and then ask one more question about it.',"",B.DZ)
B.f04=s(["admire","missing"],t.s)
B.eDX=new A.dv("t9",B.dk,"A little voice note","Send a voice note saying one thing you admire about them \u2014 no special occasion needed.","",B.f04)
B.eE0=new A.dv("t10",B.dk,"A gentle restart",'After a disagreement, try: "Can we start that again? I want to understand you."',"",B.ns)
B.f3L=s(["new","team"],t.s)
B.eDP=new A.dv("t11",B.dk,"Dream list","Write down three dreams each \u2014 for this year, for you two, for your life \u2014 and share them.","",B.f3L)
B.f0J=s(["close","steady"],t.s)
B.eEd=new A.dv("t12",B.dk,"Home",'Ask: "When do you feel most at home with me?"',"",B.f0J)
B.eDQ=new A.dv("t13",B.dk,"A memory","Share a childhood memory the other hasn\u2019t heard before.","",B.t4)
B.eEc=new A.dv("t14",B.dk,"Five-song playlist","Make a shared playlist of five songs: three from you, two from them \u2014 then swap.","",B.DZ)
B.eEz=new A.dv("t15",B.dk,"An open door",'Ask: "Is there anything on your heart you haven\u2019t told me yet?" \u2014 and just listen.',"",B.a1_)
B.eEI=new A.dv("h1",B.nf,"Love feels safe","Healthy love feels safe. You can disagree, say no, see friends and family, and still be loved. Respect is not a reward \u2014 it\u2019s the floor.","",B.zG)
B.eE1=new A.dv("h2",B.nf,"Love doesn\u2019t control","Checking your phone, controlling who you see, threats, or making you afraid are not signs of love. They are warning signs, whatever the reason given.","",B.zG)
B.f4U=s(["space","calm"],t.s)
B.eDV=new A.dv("h3",B.nf,"Boundaries are care",'Boundaries aren\u2019t walls \u2014 they tell the person you love how to love you well. "I need a little time to think" is a healthy thing to say.',"",B.f4U)
B.eE7=new A.dv("h4",B.nf,"If you ever feel unsafe","Protecting your relationship never means staying where you are hurt or afraid. If you feel unsafe, reach out \u2014 in Tanzania you can call 116 (free, 24/7) or the police on 112.","",B.zG)
B.f0y=s(["calm","repair"],t.s)
B.eEK=new A.dv("h5",B.nf,"It\u2019s okay to ask for help","Some seasons are heavy. Talking to a counsellor, a faith leader or a trusted friend is a sign of strength, for you and for your relationship.","",B.f0y)
